<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665;">less</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076;"> -S</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D;"> long.log</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD;">              # 超长行截断（不换行，方向键横向滚动）</span></span>
